{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>The first time</b><br>הקצובות — that have one measure." "מתאימות — born as twins." "<b>The second time</b><br>שניך — white, like a flock of washed ewes." "ושכולה — there is no broken tooth there, and as though they are twins." "<b>The third time</b><br>שניך — men of war."], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:10.882527332Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}